      ],
      "source": "https://visitshenandoahcounty.com/plan-your-visit/towns-and-villages/orkney-springs/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s centerpiece is the antebellum‑style Orkney Springs Hotel, now part of the Shrine Mont retreat center.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://gohikevirginia.com/orkney-springs/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Every summer, the Shenandoah Valley Music Festival turns the hotel grounds into a stage for nationally‑known musicians.",
